@startuml EnterpriseMLPlatformInferenceSequence

title Enterprise ML Platform - Model Load and Prediction Sequence

autonumber

actor Client
participant "FastAPI model router" as ModelAPI
participant "FastAPI prediction router" as PredictAPI
participant "ModelRegistry cache" as Cache
participant "MLflow registry" as MLflow
participant "ServingDriftMonitor" as Drift
participant "Worker thread" as Worker
participant "LoadedModel" as Model
participant "MetricsCollector" as Metrics

== Load an immutable model version ==

Client -> ModelAPI: POST /api/v1/models/{name}/load
ModelAPI -> Cache: load(name, alias/version)

alt registry-backed serving
    Cache -> MLflow: resolve alias or exact version
    MLflow --> Cache: immutable model version metadata
    Cache -> MLflow: load exact model version
    MLflow --> Cache: model + drift reference
else development demo mode
    Cache -> Cache: fit ephemeral demo model
end

Cache -> Cache: replace in-process cached model
Cache --> ModelAPI: ModelInfo(name, version)
ModelAPI -> Drift: register exact version + drift reference
ModelAPI --> Client: loaded model name + immutable version

== Serve a prediction ==

Client -> PredictAPI: POST /api/v1/predict
PredictAPI -> Cache: get(model_name)
Cache --> PredictAPI: LoadedModel(name, version)
PredictAPI -> PredictAPI: validate requested version and feature shape

alt model missing / wrong version / invalid shape
    PredictAPI --> Client: 4xx response
else valid request
    PredictAPI -> Drift: observe validated inputs for exact model version
    PredictAPI -> Worker: asyncio.to_thread(LoadedModel.predict)
    Worker -> Model: predict(float array)
    Model --> Worker: raw predictions
    Worker --> PredictAPI: numeric predictions

    alt model call succeeds
        PredictAPI -> Metrics: record_prediction(name, version, latency, rows)
        PredictAPI --> Client: predictions + model_version + latency_ms
    else model call fails or is cancelled
        PredictAPI -> Metrics: record_prediction_error(name, version, latency)
        PredictAPI --> Client: 5xx / cancellation
    end
end

note over Cache,Model
Prediction does not resolve the MLflow alias again.
The alias is resolved during load, then the API serves
that cached immutable version until another load occurs.
end note

@enduml
